":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"In function: refreshUniformsShadow (about line 23232 in three.js on my version)\n\nOn line 23253 under:\nshadow.matrix.identity().setPosition( _vector3 );\n\nI am getting a trigger of:\nPaused on exception: 'TypeError: Cannot read property 'identity' of null'.\n\nI can get the code to go an process correctly by adding:\nif (shadow.matric != null) \nin front of the offending statement.\n\nIn complete the line now reads:\nif (shadow.matric != null) shadow.matrix.identity().setPosition( _vector3 );\n\nWhen I do this the code works fine. (it seems)  I am not sure if this could break things down the road with other moving parts, and so I decided to mention it here so that other eyes more experienced can look over this and determine if this is the best fix, or if something better can be done.\n\nPlease let me know what the best fix for the problem I am experiencing would be, and/or if this may fix a larger bug.  My first time posting to a github project ever, and so I apologize if I may have done this incorrectly.  Let me know if I can provide better information to help update this issue.\n\nThank you,\n\nx Jeremy M.\n","closed_by":{"login":"mrdoob","id":97088,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk3MDg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97088?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob","html_url":"https://github.com/mrdoob","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/repos","events_url":"https://api.